<title>USA: PST Vans Inc CEO acquires shares.</title>
<headline>PST Vans Inc CEO acquires shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PST Vans Inc CEO Kenneth Norton said Wednesday he acquired 92,300 common shares of the company to raise his stake to 34.3 percent or 1,446,773 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Norton said he bought the shares of the Utah-based company between Feb 13 and Dec 11, 1996.</p>
<p>The filing did not list the prices per share Norton paid. But it did say he paid a total of $327,264.37 for them.</p>
<p>He holds the stake for investment.</p>
</text>
